<<endif>>
===

title: MineralProcessor11
---
Player: Hey, how are you feeling?
Jonah: I feel fantastic, foreman! Look at all this work I’m getting done!
Player: That’s good. But you know, you can rest if you’re sick.
Jonah: …
Jonah: … It’s getting louder.
Player: What’s getting louder?
Jonah: The ocean, calling to me. I can hear the entire vastness of the abyss now, echoing, beckoning… I can’t believe I couldn’t hear it before.
Jonah: I thought I was home, but I’m not. Not in here.
Player: … That’s right. You’re at work. Home is up on the surface.
Jonah: *laughs* You’re misunderstanding, foreman.
Player: Then what do you mean?
Jonah: …
